  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Red Line Silicone Ring offers a safe and durable alternative to traditional metal rings, perfect for firefighters and those who support them. Made from medical-grade silicone, this ring is built to withstand extreme conditions, including temperatures up to 150&deg;C. The non-conductive material ensures safety during electrical work or in hazardous environments. Featuring a tensile strength of 80kgf, the ring resists breakage under high tension, providing peace of mind in rigorous settings.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "425",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Red Line Silicone Ring offers a safe and durable alternative to traditional metal rings, perfect for firefighters and those who support them. Made from medical-grade silicone, this ring is built to withstand extreme conditions, including temperatures up to 150&deg;C. The non-conductive material ensures safety during electrical work or in hazardous environments. Featuring a tensile strength of 80kgf, the ring resists breakage under high tension, providing peace of mind in rigorous settings. The Thin Red Line design in the center symbolizes respect and support for firefighters, while a portion of proceeds benefits families of fallen first responders.</p>",
